Z||000007||BBBAD GT||09-05-2000||09:40 PM||||If you want to hear what a 350 in a Fiero sounds like idling with custom exhaust and late model Fbody flowmaster muffler, check out my lil movie at <A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/V8Fiero/Idle.mpg" TARGET=_blank>http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/V8Fiero/Idle.mpg</A>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/BBBAD_GT_SIG.gif">    <P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/V8Fiero" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD V8</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/Fiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD GT</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD 5.0</A>||||reg||1
Z||000008||88formula||09-05-2000||09:47 PM||||The tips that come with the Borla exhaust system are not the same ones that are on a stock GT fiero. They are exclusive to the Borla exhaust system but they do look kind of like the GT tips. I think they look better actually. I am having some pictures made up of my 3.4 formula project of which one has a close-up of those tips. If you would like I could post a picture for you.<P>The last time I called Dason Auto they were having trouble getting more exhaust systems and only had access to a few that were still on the shelf. You may only be able to get them from Fiero Parts and Appraisals. Fiero Parts and Appraisals claims that you can only get them from him but that is what he said when I found them in California. I don't know why Fiero Parts won't sell the system with the tips. He really should because those tips really look awesome.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by 88formula (edited 09-05-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000009||wilburt||09-06-2000||10:16 AM||||Yeah, please post a picture. I've noticed your tips point more stright out the rear, instead of the slightly angled out stock GTs. Your tips look like it would have a more cleaner, sharper look. Thanks for your time.<P>------------------<BR>||||reg||1
