Z||000017||GT Bastard||09-17-2000||11:03 AM||||I've heard the Borla's are pretty mellow sounding.  Is that true?  If you want your car to sound downright evil, ask 1FST2M6 about the exhaust he had made for my SE.  Flowmaster, no cat, single outlet, Chris West headers.  It gets tons of compliments on the exhaust note.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000018||rockcrawl||09-17-2000||07:22 PM||||I've heard the borla system on a V8 Camaro, and personally I don't like the mellow sound. I like the fact that it's stainless, but I prefer the flowmaster sound.<P>------------------<BR>Jon Lagler<BR>'86 GT 3800 (for sale)<BR>'87 GT (noisey 2.8)<BR>4.9 liter V8 Testarossa Spyder (under construction)||||reg||1
